steps.task:
Implement api_generate_instagram_caption handler in api.rs. The handler fetches artist + assigned show, calls AI for show-context bio, then assembles the full caption string using this template:

"UNHEARD Guest: {artist_name}

{ai_show_bio}

{ai_bio}

Track 1: "{track1_name}"
Track 2: "{track2_name}"

Soundcloud link in Bio.

@{instagram_handle}"

Stores result in artists.instagram_caption, returns JSON with caption text.
